        <mxCell id="title" value="&lt;b&gt;DEPLOYMENT DIAGRAM - SMART AGRO SYSTEM (local deployment)&lt;/b&gt;" style="text;html=1;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;fontSize=16;fontColor=#000000;fontStyle=1" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="450" y="20" width="600" height="40" as="geometry" />
